#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:5
#: b11d2f0296fd4fe88fb606eb98e34e93
msgid "AmovLab P200"
msgstr "AmovLab P200"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:9
#: bbebd898c7b74aa6b068c62a584a6abf
msgid ""
"The AmovLab P200 is an almost-ready-to-fly quadcopter designed for "
"education and research users especially those who wish to mount a "
"companion computer like the :ref:`NVidia TX2 <dev:companion-computer-"
"nvidia-tx2>`"
msgstr ""
"AmovLab P200是一款准即飞四旋翼飞行器，专为教育和科研用户设计，尤其适合希望安装 :ref:`NVidia TX2 <dev"
":companion-computer-nvidia-tx2>` 等伴飞计算机的用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:12
#: 86821f973ec64595bb1adcbc6e182bd1
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:14
#: 1a58caf223f642889bdda96a2411da1d
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The frame will be available for purchase from late 2019 onwards from many"
" `CubePilot resellers <https://www.cubepilot.com/#/reseller/list>`__"
msgstr "该机架将于2019年底起通过众多 `Hex经销商 <http://www.proficnc.com/stores>`__ 销售"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:15
#: c16ccbfa3e5f452a8ae5f6e993280e75
msgid "3300mAh to 5300mAh 3S battery"
msgstr "3300mAh至5300mAh 3S电池"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:16
#: 942f536039f644e3828f454d2cd2be11
msgid "RC transmitter with at least 6 channels like the Futaba T10J"
msgstr "至少6通道的RC遥控器，如Futaba T10J"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:19
#: 2a6158eb08864ed78bc91d12930483b8
msgid "Connection and Setup"
msgstr "连接与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:21
#: 995cdb9d0a4548ae98b2192a1c11294b
msgid ""
"Mount the RC receiver to the frame and connect to the autopilot's \"RC "
"IN\" port.  Note that the white wire should be at the bottom"
msgstr "将RC接收机安装到机架上，并连接到飞控的\"RC IN\"端口。注意白线应朝下"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-amovlab-p200.rst:23
#: f5f99bcafe754a17bb77652b369a705d
msgid "Firmware used: Copter-4.0"
msgstr "使用固件版本：Copter-4.0"

