msgid ""
"This parameter file can also be loaded using the Mission Planner's "
"Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter Tree page by selecting \"amovlab-p200\" "
"from the drop down on the middle right and then push the \"Load "
"Presaved\" button."
msgstr ""
"该参数文件也可通过 Mission Planner 的Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter "
"Tree页面加载，在右侧中部下拉菜单中选择\"amovlab-p200\"，然后点击\"Load Presaved\"按钮。"

